# GS12, after vale_day1_continue.keys (the Vale day-one save loaded, f1958): day one in Vale by real play to Sol
# Sanctum. Story order from the vendor scenes (vale.c, vale_kradens_cottage.c, sol_sanctum_entrance.c): the puppies
# (behaviours 20/21) wall the south way to Kraden's until the party has met Saturos and Menardi, so the way is the
# north exit (0,38-40) past the woman who asks "Do you need to go past here?" (Yes; she stays, go round her by row 40);
# ValeKradensCottage: walking past the strangers (behaviour 7 at 23-25,20) plays the Saturos and Menardi scene
# (f3478-6920); behaviour 5 (17,19) Kraden wondering (f7327-8720); talking to Kraden (14,14) plans the Sol Sanctum
# visit, the cottage, Kraden sets off (f9060-14500); back into Vale by the east exit; past the man guarding Mt. Aleph
# (his question at f15900, answered; sneaking past while he walks his patrol, f16250); Sol Entrance (f16645), the
# side stairs onto the door's platform (the middle has none), the door (f17120), Sol Sanctum and Kraden's
# introduction (f17141-17750). Inputs only. B (not A) closes the last messages: A in the field opens the menu.
